  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the implementation of net-zero nature-positive (NZNP) solutions in Viet Nam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Supporting the implementation of net-zero nature-positive (NZNP) solutions in Viet Nam. As described in the project concept (PIF/child project concept note), this project aims to support Viet Nam to enhance the implementation of NZNP solutions that reduces Greenhouse Gases (GHG) emissions (mainly methane emissions), while at the same time, bring biodiversity and land conservation co-benefits, both at the national</narrative>
  </description>
